<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank 2-week rev repo average yield 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank 2-week rev repo average yield 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Monday that average, maximum and minimum yield in a two-week reverse repo operation to drain liquidity, was 14.5 percent and all bids were accepted.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>	  prague.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
